IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INTEREST25.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-N PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-I PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.

01 WS-INPUT-LINE PIC X(100).

01 WS-ACCOUNT-ID PIC X(12).
01 WS-BALANCE-TEXT PIC X(20).
01 WS-RATE-TEXT PIC X(10).

01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(11)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-ANNUAL-RATE PIC 99V99 COMP-3.

01 WS-MONTHLY-INTEREST PIC 9(11)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-TOTAL-INTEREST PIC 9(13)V99 COMP-3
   VALUE ZERO.

01 WS-INTEREST-OUT PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
01 WS-TOTAL-OUT PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

MAIN-PARA.

    DISPLAY "================================"
    DISPLAY " INTEREST POSTING FOR ACCOUNTS"
    DISPLAY "================================"

    DISPLAY "ENTER NUMBER OF ACCOUNTS:"
    ACCEPT WS-N

    IF WS-N < 1 OR WS-N > 10000

       DISPLAY "ERROR: INVALID ACCOUNT COUNT"
       MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE
       STOP RUN

    END-IF

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1
       UNTIL WS-I > WS-N

       DISPLAY "ENTER ACCOUNT ID, BALANCE, RATE:"

       ACCEPT WS-INPUT-LINE

       MOVE SPACES TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID
       MOVE SPACES TO WS-BALANCE-TEXT
       MOVE SPACES TO WS-RATE-TEXT

       UNSTRING WS-INPUT-LINE
          DELIMITED BY ALL SPACES
          INTO WS-ACCOUNT-ID
               WS-BALANCE-TEXT
               WS-RATE-TEXT
       END-UNSTRING

       COMPUTE WS-BALANCE =
          FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-BALANCE-TEXT)

       COMPUTE WS-ANNUAL-RATE =
          FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-RATE-TEXT)

       COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY-INTEREST ROUNDED =
          WS-BALANCE * WS-ANNUAL-RATE / 1200

       ADD WS-MONTHLY-INTEREST
          TO WS-TOTAL-INTEREST

       MOVE WS-MONTHLY-INTEREST
          TO WS-INTEREST-OUT

       DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ACCOUNT-ID)
          " " WS-INTEREST-OUT

    END-PERFORM

    MOVE WS-TOTAL-INTEREST TO WS-TOTAL-OUT

    DISPLAY "--------------------------------"
    DISPLAY "TOTAL INTEREST: " WS-TOTAL-OUT
    DISPLAY "================================"

    MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE

    STOP RUN.
